<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#4078F2;--shiki-dark:#61AFEF;">│</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;">       └──</span><span style="--shiki-light:#50A14F;--shiki-dark:#98C379;"> SKILL.md</span></span>
